      "value": "Upper bound L_a given by Equation (2), with the maximum deadline and the maximum T_i-D_i term.",
      "expression": "L_a=\\max\\left\\{D_1,\\ldots,D_n,\\ \\max_{1\\leq i\\leq n}\\{T_i-D_i\\}\\frac{U}{1-U}\\right\\}",
      "label": "Equation (2)",
      "scope": {
